_url" : "https://ccmixter.org/content/SackJo22/SackJo22_-_Slippin_Slidin_.flac", "local_path" : "/var/www/ccmixter/content/SackJo22/SackJo22_-_Slippin_Slidin_.flac", "file_rawsize" : 5982763}], "upload_description_plain" : "cc-plus license available for use outside of cc-by license.\r\n\r\nStephen Fewell invited me to write some lyrics and melody.  Inspired by the slide guitar in the track, I came up with Slippin' & Slidin'.\r\n\r\nDry vox stems uploaded as mp3 and flac in zip files.\r\n\r\nUPDATE:  It was brought to my attention the lead vox in the zip files is not dry.  I am super swamped but will replace all eventually.  If you want dry, clean files in the interim, send me a note.  Meanwhile, I did re-up a dry lead flac. -- 020511\r\n\r\n\r\nSLIPPIN' & SLIDIN'\r\n\r\nSlippin' and slidin'\r\nsliding away\r\nEverything I once knew, crumbles and dissipates\r\nMy heart once filled with love, is now filled with shame\r\n'Cuz you don't look back when you walk away.\r\n\r\nSlippin' & slidin'\r\nsliding away\r\nWhat once was a home is now just another space\r\nI gave you all I had to give and you took it without grace\r\nNow you don't look back when you walk away.\r\n\r\nI reach for you\r\nYou don't extend\r\ntime and time and time again\r\nYou say to me, I'm your only woman\r\nYou say to me, I'm your heaven\r\n\r\nI reach for you\r\nYou don't extend\r\nTime and time and time again\r\nWell what you don't say, I can see\r\nThe words, the love, the disparity\r\n\r\nSlippin' & slidin'\r\nSliding away\r\nI should have known I'd see this day\r\nGlimmer shadows into grey\r\nWhat we need is not the same\r\nAnd you don't look back when you walk away", "upload_description_html" : " <a title=\"http://tunetrack.net/license/ccmixter.org/files/SackJo22/30330\" class=\"cc_format_link\" href=\"http://tunetrack.net/license/ccmixter.org/files/SackJo22/30330\">cc-plus license available for use outside of cc-by license.</a><br />\r\n<br />\r\nStephen Fewell invited me to write some lyrics and melody.  Inspired by the slide guitar in the track, I came up with Slippin&#8217; & Slidin&#8217;.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDry vox stems uploaded as mp3 and flac in zip files.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span class=\"i\"><span class=\"b\">UPDATE</span>:  It was brought to my attention the lead vox in the zip files is not dry.  I am super swamped but will replace all eventually.  If you want dry, clean files in the interim, send me a note.  Meanwhile, I did re-up a dry lead flac. &#8212; <span class=\"small\">020511</span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSLIPPIN&#8217; & SLIDIN&#8217;<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSlippin&#8217; and slidin&#8217;<br />\r\nsliding away<br />\r\nEverything I once knew, crumbles and dissipates<br />\r\nMy heart once filled with love, is now filled with shame<br />\r\n&#8216;Cuz you don&#8217;t look back when you walk away.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSlippin&#8217; & slidin&#8217;<br />\r\nsliding away<br />\r\nWhat once was a home is now just another space<br />\r\nI gave you all I had to give and you took it without grace<br />\r\nNow you don&#8217;t look back when you walk away.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nI reach for you<br />\r\nYou don&#8217;t extend<br />\r\ntime and time and time again<br />\r\nYou say to me, I&#8217;m your only woman<br />\r\nYou say to me, I&#8217;m your heaven<br />\r\n<br />\r\nI reach for you<br />\r\nYou don&#8217;t extend<br />\r\nTime and time and time again<br />\r\nWell what you don&#8217;t say, I can see<br />\r\nThe words, the love, the disparity<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSlippin&#8217; & slidin&#8217;<br />\r\nSliding away<br />\r\nI should have known I&#8217;d see this day<br />\r\nGlimmer shadows into grey<br />\r\nWhat we need is not the same<br />\r\nAnd you don&#8217;t look back when you walk away"},{"upload_id" : 30243, "upload_name" : "GROWING", "upload_extra" : {"usertags" : "alternative,classic,r_and_b,theflyingteam", "ccud" : "media,remix,bpm_090_095,ccplus", "systags" : "attribution,audio,mp3,44k,stereo,CBR", "featuring" : "Mykl